<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 7.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 7.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	April 7     April 4    Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  269.360     265.450     247.020    9.04 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  308.500     308.290     306.830    0.54 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.100     158.360     158.970   -0.55 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.966	47.028	47.182   -0.46 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  437.700     433.700     419.180    4.42 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.500     140.720     141.685   -0.84 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.036	15.969	16.185   -0.92 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  214.610     214.020     212.430    1.03 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.871	 1.871	 1.888   -0.90 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.576	 1.575	 1.581   -0.32 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  183.755     184.750     183.135    0.34 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Athens Newsroom +301-3311812-4</p>
</text>
